Revision history for CryptoKit

0.01    2026-10-22
        - Initial release
        - Argon2id password hashing (CryptoKit::Hash)
        - Strong random password generation (CryptoKit::Password)
        - ECC key generation and signing (CryptoKit::Key)
        - Hybrid ECC + AES-GCM encryption (CryptoKit::Encrypt)
        - Secure memory and constant-time comparison (CryptoKit::Secure)
